WEBVTT

00:03:26.323 --> 00:03:31.684
a world where we can meet the needs

00:03:31.708 --> 00:03:35.169
of the present generations,

00:03:35.193 --> 00:03:37.556
including everyone,

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:43.597
without compromising the possibilities
of future generations.

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:48.422
I would like to invite
all people of faith,

00:03:48.446 --> 00:03:50.728
Christian or not,

00:03:50.752 --> 00:03:54.036
and all people of good will,

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:57.408
to embark on this journey,

00:03:59.448 --> 00:04:01.743
starting from your own faith,